WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Materials around a car. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: Classify metal, polymer, glass and fluid

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: Cars combine metals, polymers, glass, elastomers, fluids and composites. Material choice depends on loads, environment, process and repair.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: Sort an example component by material class, then state what additional data selection would need.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: Material card sort

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: Material category alone does not guarantee strength, durability or safety.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: Classify metal, polymer, glass and fluid
